{"id":"cdd1f74aa0c940f7","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition.md","title":"平行移动命题","display":"lem-parallel-moves-proposition — 平行移动命题","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition","aliases":["56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition"],"display":"lem-parallel-moves-proposition — 平行移动命题","depends_on":["[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","[[56-lem-parallel-substitution]]","[[56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation]]"],"source_section":"§4.3 Proposition 4.3.2; §4.7 Lemma 4.7.8","source_printed_pages":"100–101,122–123","source_ocr_blocks":[121,122,143,144],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-parallel-moves-proposition — 平行移动命题"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a7c117bc54a8d10\" href=\"?note=1a7c117bc54a8d10\" title=\"56-lem-parallel-substitution\">56-lem-parallel-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b4594163bf46851f\" href=\"?note=b4594163bf46851f\" title=\"56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation\">56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.3 Proposition 4.3.2; §4.7 Lemma 4.7.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"100–101,122–123"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>121</span><span>122</span><span>143</span><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^*\">\\(\\to_R^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_R\">\\(\\Rightarrow_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,w\\in T\">\\(s,t,w\\in T\\)</span>；平行替换相容性与真左部模式保持分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1a7c117bc54a8d10\" href=\"?note=1a7c117bc54a8d10\" title=\"56-lem-parallel-substitution\">56-lem-parallel-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b4594163bf46851f\" href=\"?note=b4594163bf46851f\" title=\"56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation\">56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\to_R t\\land s\\Rightarrow_R w)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in T\\;(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\land w\\to_R^*v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\to_R t\\land s\\Rightarrow_R w)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in T\\;(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\land w\\to_R^*v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用平行步的三个结构分支归纳；位置定义与这三个分支的对应已在平行替换引理中证明。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 为变量时没有一步收缩，前提不成立。</li>\n<li>平行步收缩根规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\to r\">\\(l\\to r\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=l\\sigma,\\ w=r\\sigma\">\\(s=l\\sigma,\\ w=r\\sigma\\)</span>。若另一单步也在根，正交性迫使两规则相同，左线性使规则变量上的匹配一致，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=w\">\\(t=w\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=t\">\\(v=t\\)</span>。若另一单步在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个儿子内部，真左部模式引理把该变化吸收到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 的变量替换中，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=l\\theta\">\\(t=l\\theta\\)</span>，且各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\theta\">\\(x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\theta\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=r\\theta\">\\(v=r\\theta\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 通过根收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=r\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R r\\theta\">\\(w=r\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R r\\theta\\)</span> 由平行替换引理得到，顺序收缩其有限不交见证即给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\to_R^*v\">\\(w\\to_R^*v\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>平行步在函数儿子内组合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\">\\(s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=f(w_1,\\ldots,w_n)\">\\(w=f(w_1,\\ldots,w_n)\\)</span>。若单步在根 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\sigma\\to r\\sigma\">\\(l\\sigma\\to r\\sigma\\)</span>，对每个左部儿子使用真模式引理，并由左线性合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=l\\theta\">\\(w=l\\theta\\)</span> 且各规则变量的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 像平行归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 像。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=r\\theta\">\\(v=r\\theta\\)</span>，用平行替换引理得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=r\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R v\">\\(t=r\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R v\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 根收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。若单步在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个儿子，归纳给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_k\\Rightarrow_R v_k\\leftarrow_R^*w_k\">\\(t_k\\Rightarrow_R v_k\\leftarrow_R^*w_k\\)</span>；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_k\">\\(v_k\\)</span> 放回该儿子，其余儿子取平行步的目标，组成所需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。在本儿子组合分支，常元仅有空平行步，不存在儿子内收缩；常元的根收缩属于规则分支。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每个平行步都可按任意顺序收缩其有限不交位置，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_R\\subseteq\\to_R^*\">\\(\\Rightarrow_R\\subseteq\\to_R^*\\)</span>；这是上述第2分支及后续归纳的有限路径依据。相交的左部变量取值可被复制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 一侧通常需要多步；不要求全系统终止。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), §4.3 的 PMP 陈述及 §4.7 Lemma 4.7.8 的完整分类证明。此原子给其项端点版本；指明每条边收缩哪些残余是更精细的残余版本，并非由端点单独定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-parallel-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"1a7c117bc54a8d10","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-parallel-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"b4594163bf46851f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\to_R$、$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]；$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\to_R$、$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]；$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。","embed":false},